  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>졩<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>폔<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>주<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>믕<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>’릐</span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/l-VKXQ6jbz4?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>天頂<rt>틸ˉ뎽ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>仙女<rt>셴ˉ릐ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-siâ̰-mîh goà chīn-chiṵ̄, thḭ̄-tièng’e siēn-lì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>古早<rt>거ˆ자ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>西施<rt>세ˉ시ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-siâ̰-mîh goà chīn-chiṵ̄, kôr-jà’e sē-sî\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>’꽈, <ruby>千千萬萬<rt>쳰ˉ쳰ˉ빤빤-</rt></ruby><ruby>年<rt>니ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-siâ̰-mîh lì ai’goa, chiēn-chiēn-ban-ban-ní\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>變<rt>볜ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>心意<rt>심ˉ이</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-siâ̰-mîh lì yêng-oàn, boe-lai-pièn-sīm-i\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>原來<rt>꽌래ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>花言巧語<rt>화ˉ꼔카ˆ끠ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>真情<rt>진ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>騙騙<rt>폔ˋ폔</rt></ruby>’킈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goan-lái lì si-hoā-gien-khâ-gì, jīn-jiéng hor-lì phièn-phien&#8217;khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>原來<rt>꽌래ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>空喙薄舌<rt>캉ˉ취ˋ봏짛ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>達<rt>닫-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>目的<rt>뻑뎩ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>做<rt>죄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>去<rt>킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goan-lái lì si-khāng-chùi-poh-jîh, tat-tioh-bork-tiêk joè-lî-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐, <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā~ goà mn̄g&#8217;li, ā~ goà mn̄g&#8217;li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>良心<rt>령심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>到底<rt>ᄃᅷˋ되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>在<rt